      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm not saying it's scientifically proven yet, but it's hard to ignore when it's happening right in front of me. it feels too real to just be \"pseudoscience.\" if it's not some external thing, then it has to be coming from me. i feel like i'm constantly on edge because i don't know when the next \"surge\" is gonna happen and mess something up at the office. are there any ways to, i don't know, stabilize my energy or something? like, ways to keep this from leaking out when i'm stressed?",
